            "review_title": "Review at Pyramids Restaurant Halal",
            "review_text": "Reda S\nNha Trang, Vietnam17 contributions\n0\nTrue flavors of Egypt in Ho Chi Minh\nOct 2025 • Couples\nI actually took a one hour flight just to eat here and it was totally worth it! They have almost every Egyptian dish you can think of: koshari, fool, molokhiya, falafel, and so much more. Chef Remon is incredibly talented; every plate is packed with flavor and feels like home. The owner is a true gentleman , warm, generous, and genuinely friendly. You don’t just come here for the food, you come for the experience. Absolutely worth the trip!\nRead more\nWritten October 12, 2025",
